<rml>
<head>
    <title>Explore game menu</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="explore.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- Explore mode's game menu (task explore 02): Esc in a run. Resume (or Esc)
     goes back to the run, Wait opens the wait while walking (task explore
     06; hidden otherwise), Main menu leaves it, Exit quits. It pauses nothing:
     a server's run cannot be paused by one player. TSRE wires the items by
     their ids (src/explore/ExploreRun.cpp). -->
<body class="page">
    <div id="game-menu">
        <button id="resume">ui.explore.resume</button>
        <button id="wait">ui.explore.wait</button>
        <button id="main-menu">ui.explore.main.menu</button>
        <button id="exit">ui.explore.exit</button>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
